      "message": "Merge main into issue/797-a-only-pose (.claude/PROCESS_VERSION: take main's 12)\n\nConflict was only the process version number; the branch's older sync (10) is superseded by main's 12. Both sides' code auto-merged; no hunk changed the same logic. Targeted tests on the merge: fourth_axis_pose, machine, tormach_fourth_axis, microarc_test_part all green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
